  "prefLabel": "Sw 3001.06 Ineligible Tickets",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 3001.06 Ineligible Tickets.\n\n(a) If a ticket does not meet the requirements of Sw 3001.05, the ticket shall be deemed void and ineligible for any prize.\n\nSource. #6356, eff 10-22-96; ss by #8162, eff 9-9-04; ss by #8367, eff 6-2-05; ss by #8543, eff 1-21-06; ss by #9519, eff 7-25-09, EXPIRED: 7-25-17",
